{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A little over a year ago, a stranger very\nnearly sold Graceland."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4780,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not the family who owns it. A thief, using\nnothing but forged paper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9520,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The famous home of Elvis Presley, one of\nthe most recognized houses in the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14020,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "entire country, was almost auctioned off\nto a buyer over fake documents and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19700,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a signature that was never real."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21620,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was caught, but only barely, with about\none day to spare before the sale"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26660,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would have gone through. And it took the\nauthorities three long months afterward"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30540,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just to trace who was behind it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32940,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now here is what I need you to sit with\nfor a moment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36120,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If a thief can walk up and nearly steal\none of the most famous homes in America,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40500,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in broad daylight, with nothing more than\na few forged papers, then think about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45740,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how much easier it is to do that same\nthing to an ordinary, paid-off home like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50620,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yours. A home nobody famous is watching."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53560,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A home where there is no bank, no lender,\nno one at all keeping an eye on the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58060,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "title. It is a fast growing crime, and\nolder people who own their homes free"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63600,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and clear are the favorite target of all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66160,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Over the next few minutes I am going to\nshow you exactly how it works, why"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71160,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your paid-off home is the one they want\nmost, the single free step that shuts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76220,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the whole thing down, and the popular paid\nservice you should never waste your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81060,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "money on. Let me begin with why they are\ncoming for you in particular."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84820,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a cold reason these thieves go\nlooking for gray hair and a paid-off"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90380,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "home. Think about it from their side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92460,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A younger family with a mortgage has a\nbank standing behind them, watching"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97040,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the property closely, because the bank\nowns a piece of it too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100620,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But once you have made that final payment,\nonce the home is fully and completely"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104880,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yours, that watchful eye goes away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107880,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is no lender checking the records\nanymore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110400,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is only you. And if you are like\nmost people, you have not looked at"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114640,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your property records in years, perhaps\nnot since the day you first signed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119200,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the house. That is the opening they\nare hunting for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123400,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A home with a great deal of value built up\ninside it, owned free and clear,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128320,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by someone who is not watching it closely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131300,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the numbers tell the story plainly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133780,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In a single recent year, federal crime\ninvestigators logged more than nine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139060,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thousand complaints of this kind of real\nestate fraud, with victims losing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143560,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over one hundred and seventy million\ndollars between them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146740,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here is the figure that should stop\nevery older homeowner cold."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151120,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While seniors were only about one in five\nof the people who complained, they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156100,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "accounted for nearly half of all the money\nlost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159080,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let that settle for a second. Older"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161540,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "homeowners are a smaller share of the\nvictims,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163720,
    "dDurationMs": 5580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they lose far more, because the homes\nthey own are worth more and are watched"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169300,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "less. You are not imagining that you are a\ntarget."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172660,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the cold arithmetic of these criminals,\nyou are the target."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176880,
    "dDurationMs": 6140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there is one group they hunt with\nspecial care, so let me name it, in case"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183020,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it is you or someone you love."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185080,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you own a second home, or a property\nthat sits empty for part of the year,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189540,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or if you spend your winters somewhere\nwarmer and leave a house standing behind"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193780,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you, you are an even richer prize, because\na home no one is living in can be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199080,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stolen, and even rented out or sold,\nbefore anyone notices at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203780,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The same is true for a home recently left\nbehind after a husband or wife has"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208820,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "passed, in the very season when everything\nis already in confusion and grief."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213700,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These thieves read obituaries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215980,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They watch for the empty house and the\ndarkened windows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219540,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If any of that describes your life, then\nthe steps I am about to give you matter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224160,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for you most of all. So let me show you\nexactly how they do it, because once"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229700,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you see how simple it is, you will\nunderstand why it works so often, and why"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234840,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the fix matters so much. It begins with\nyour personal information, the ordinary"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240240,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kind that leaks out in the data breaches\nwe have all lived through."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243680,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your name, your address, your date of\nbirth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246560,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With that, a thief fills out a deed, the\nsingle piece of paper that says who"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251840,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "owns your home. They forge your signature\non it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254620,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They find a way to get it notarized,\nsometimes with a crooked notary, sometimes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259580,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by fooling an honest one. And then they\nsimply walk it into your county office,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263900,
    "dDurationMs": 6220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or mail it in, and file it. And here is\nthe hard truth that shocks people the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270120,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "most. In most places, no one at that\ncounty office calls you to check."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275600,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No one knocks on your door to ask whether\nyou really meant to sign your home"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279860,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "away. The clerk records what is filed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282840,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the job. The paper goes into the\nrecord, and just like that, on paper,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288720,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your home now belongs to someone else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291520,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From there the damage moves fast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294340,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes they take out a loan against\nyour home, pocket the money, and vanish,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299520,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "leaving the debt sitting on your house."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301900,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes they try to sell it out from\nunder you, exactly as they tried with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306360,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Graceland. And the cruelest part is how\nyou find out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309360,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is almost never a warning. It is a loan\nbill for money you never borrowed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313820,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a notice of foreclosure on a home\nyou paid off years ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317640,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a letter congratulating the new\nowners."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320320,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the time that envelope lands in your\nmailbox, the crime is already done,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325020,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and untangling it can take many months of\nlawyers and heartache."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329000,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the whole game comes down to one thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331460,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Knowing the very moment a piece of paper\ntouches your title, instead of finding"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336240,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out long after the fact. Let me make this\nreal with the kind of story that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341160,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "quietly plays out somewhere in this\ncountry almost every single week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345700,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Picture a widow who paid off her home\ndecades ago, the house where she raised"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350400,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "her children, the one thing on this earth\nshe was certain no one could ever"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354500,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "take from her. She was careful with her\nmoney, and she owed nothing to anyone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358980,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then one ordinary afternoon a letter\narrived, saying her home was scheduled"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364100,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be sold, over a loan she had never\ntaken out, against a deed she had never"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369500,
    "dDurationMs": 5780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "signed. Someone she had never met had\nforged her name, borrowed a small fortune"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375280,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "against her house, and vanished into the\nair."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378080,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She had done nothing wrong. She had simply\nnever been told that such a thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382780,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was even possible, and so she had never\nset up the one free warning that would"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387580,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have caught it on the very first day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389960,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Months of fear and lawyers followed, all\nof it to undo something that a single"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394540,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "free alert would have stopped before it\never began."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397980,
    "dDurationMs": 5380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Her story is the reason I am making this\nvideo, so that it never becomes yours."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403620,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that brings me to the single most\nimportant thing in this entire video,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408440,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the one free step that quietly shuts this\nwhole crime down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412700,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is called a property alert, or a deed\nalert, and a great many county offices"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418660,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "across the country now offer it,\ncompletely free of charge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422940,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is what it does. You sign up one\ntime, with the office in your county"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427680,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that records property documents, and from\nthat day forward, the moment anyone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432880,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "files anything at all against your home, a\ndeed, a loan, a transfer, a claim,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438440,
    "dDurationMs": 6180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you are told. A message, an email, a\nletter, right away, while there is still"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444620,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "time to stop it, instead of months later\nwhen the damage is already done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449400,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think about what that means against\neverything I just described."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454240,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The thief can still forge the paper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456600,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They can still try to file it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458600,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the instant they do, you know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461700,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And a fraud that depends entirely on you\nnot noticing simply falls apart the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467060,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "moment you are the one watching."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468760,
    "dDurationMs": 5380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is the closest thing there is to a lock\non your title, and in most places"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474260,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it costs you nothing but a few minutes to\nset up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477640,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is your one action from today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480660,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Call your county recorder, or your county\nclerk, or whatever office keeps the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486120,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "property records where you live, and ask\nthem one simple question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490000,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you offer a free property alert or deed\nalert service, and how do I sign"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495100,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "up. If they have it, sign up that very\nday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498180,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If they do not, ask how you can check your\nown property record, because in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502740,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "most counties you can look it up for free,\nany time you like."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506600,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Simply making a habit of checking it two\nor three times a year is a quiet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511580,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "powerful protection all on its own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514300,
    "dDurationMs": 5580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I have to warn you about something,\nbecause if I do not, someone else will"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519880,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "happily take advantage of the very fear\nthis video might stir up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523640,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have probably seen the advertisements."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526200,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The ones on television and online, run by\ncompanies promising to protect your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531020,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "home with something they call title lock,\nfor a monthly fee."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534380,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And after everything I have just told you,\nthat sounds like exactly what you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 538720,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "need. So let me be plain with you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 541520,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those paid services do not actually stop a\nthief from filing a false deed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547700,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They cannot. What most of them really do\nis watch the public record and tell"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553440,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you after something has already been\nfiled, which is very often the same thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558560,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the free alert from your own county will\ndo, except now you are paying every"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563640,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "single month for it. I am not telling you\nthose companies are breaking the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568000,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "law. I am telling you that you should not\nhand over a monthly fee out of fear"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 572620,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for something your own county very likely\noffers for nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576280,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there is one more piece of protection\nworth knowing about, because you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580300,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "may already own it. If you bought what is\ncalled an owner title insurance policy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584820,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "back when you first purchased your home,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587160,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that policy can help protect you\nfinancially"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589520,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if a fraudulent claim ever lands on your\nproperty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592940,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A great many people have it and have long\nsince forgotten."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597420,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So before you ever pay a company a monthly\nfee, do two things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602000,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sign up for the free alert from your\ncounty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604480,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And dig out the closing papers from when\nyou bought the home, and see whether"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609020,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you already hold title insurance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611220,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Between those two, you have most of the\nreal protection there is, and it costs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616440,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you little or nothing at all. And while\nyou are guarding the front door, let"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 621860,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "me give you two more simple locks for the\nside windows, because thieves rarely"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626440,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rely on just one way in. The first is your\ncredit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630440,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because this crime so often begins with a\nstolen identity, placing a freeze"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635260,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on your credit with the major credit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 637300,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bureaus is one of the strongest and\nsimplest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640160,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things you can do. It is free, you can\nlift it any time you need to, and it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645380,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "makes it far harder for anyone to borrow\nagainst your name or your home."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 650340,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second is your mail. So much of this\nbegins or ends with a letter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655260,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A notice you were not expecting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 657200,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A statement for an account you never\nopened."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660080,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A piece of official looking real estate\nmail about a property matter you know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664420,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nothing about. Do not toss those aside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666860,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Open them, read them, and if something\nlooks wrong, act on it that same week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672300,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you have a son, or a daughter, or a\ntrusted person who helps you with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676540,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things, let them help you here too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678800,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sit down together, set up the county alert\nas a team, and check the property"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 683560,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "record now and then. This is not a burden\nto place on your family."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687280,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is one of the most practical gifts you\ncan give one another, the shared"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 691040,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "peace of knowing the home is safe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692980,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let me leave you with the whole of it,\nsimply."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 695440,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The home you own free and clear, the one\nyou spent a lifetime paying for, is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 700200,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "exactly the kind of home these thieves\nlook for, precisely because no one is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704500,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "watching it. But that is also the good\nnews, because the fix is almost entirely"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708940,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in your own hands, and it is very nearly\nfree."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712180,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You do not need to live in fear, and you\ncertainly do not need to pay a monthly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716160,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fee to a company selling that fear back to\nyou."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 719040,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You simply need to be the one who is\nwatching."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 721560,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sign up for the free alert with your\ncounty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 723740,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Check your property record a few times a\nyear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726600,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Freeze your credit. Open your mail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729080,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And keep the papers from the day you\nbought your home somewhere you can find"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 732840,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "them. Do those few things, and a crime\nthat works only in the dark, only when"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737680,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "no one is looking, quietly loses all of\nits power over you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 741300,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The thief is counting on your silence and\nyour inattention."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744720,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Take those two things away, and there is\nalmost nothing left for him to steal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 748980,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So take one action today. Find your county\nrecorder, and ask about that free"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753960,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "alert. It is a handful of minutes that can\nprotect the single biggest thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 757760,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you own. And if you know another"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759380,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "homeowner, a neighbor, a friend, someone\nwho"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 762500,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "worked their whole life to pay off a home\nand does not yet know any of this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766500,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "please send this to them. It may be the\nvery thing that keeps their home in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770000,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their own hands."
    } ]
  } ]
}
